{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118383","id":3514535085,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Re4yt","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118383","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118383.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118383.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118383","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118383/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118383/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118383/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e4db57213450ef51580c5829c2ae8db2260c35dc","number":118383,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize performance when selecting and dragging multiple keys","user":{"login":"rinevard","id":136295900,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB-13A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136295900?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard","html_url":"https://github.com/rinevard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinevard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I select and drag 895 keys in the videos below.\r\n\r\n|Before|After|\r\n|-|-|\r\n|<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2876bebf-b8a3-478e-b8fa-ef77bc498394\">|<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f9c63d3-0601-4071-b916-fe38bb68dcc1\">|\r\n\r\n**Laggy reason**\r\n\r\nAs shown in the profiler screenshot below, the performance bottleneck when selecting and moving multiple keys is `AnimationTrackEditor::_update_key_edit`. During the `// 7 - Reselect.` step in `AnimationTrackEditor::_move_selection_commit`, the UndoRedo system calls `_select_at_anim` for every selected key. Consequently, `_update_key_edit` is executed $O(N)$ times. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"752\" alt=\"analysiss\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fae2ec90-2c39-4ae4-bb26-431f6a8d916a\" />\r\n\r\n**Solution**\r\n\r\nWhat `_update_key_edit` does is notifying EditorNode about the current editing target. So it is sufficient to only call it once after `selection` is completely updated. To fix the lag, I deffered the actual update logic using call_deferred and track a pending flag to ensure the update logic is only executed once.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":